  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Pinned --bc-version values now resolve released Business Central artifacts first across build, workspace build, artifact commands and compatibility validation, fixing 404 failures for released builds.\n      Exact builds fall back to Insider only when not released; major.minor prefixes never fall back to Insider. Artifact messages report the actual source.\n      CHANGELOG.md contains the complete details.",
